# Keep the build context tiny and deterministic.
.git
.gitignore
README.md
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
imagedefinitions.json

# Dashboard build artefacts. Both MUST be excluded:
#
#   node_modules  a local install is large, platform-specific, and would be copied
#                 into the Node stage only to be overwritten by `npm ci` - slowing
#                 every build and breaking it outright when the host is macOS and the
#                 stage is linux.
#   dist          a stale local build would be copied in and then replaced by the
#                 fresh one, but any file the new build does not emit would survive
#                 and ship. That is how a deleted asset keeps being served.
ui/node_modules/
ui/dist/

# Editor and tooling noise that has no business in a build context.
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.log
